# Layered on tvb-o-clinical.ttl, so the clinical knowledge graph reaches runnable models: each clinical application study tied to the TVB-O model record that implements the node dynamics it used, and each clinical model family tied by a SKOS match to the records that implement it (exactMatch, narrowMatch for a family several records refine, closeMatch for a record in another formulation, relatedMatch for a family of networks whose single neuron a record gives).
@prefix tvbo: <https://w3id.org/tvbo/> .
@prefix tvbc: <https://w3id.org/tvbo/clinical/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

tvbc:study-Yang2015 tvbc:usesNodeDynamics <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/ReducedWongWang> .
tvbc:study-Mana2023 tvbc:usesNodeDynamics <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/SupHopf> .
tvbc:study-Stefanovski2019 tvbc:usesNodeDynamics <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/JansenRit> .

tvbc:model-JansenRit skos:exactMatch <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/JansenRit> .
tvbc:model-ReducedWongWang skos:narrowMatch <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/ReducedWongWang> , <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/ReducedWongWangExcInh> , <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/DecoBalancedExcInh> .
tvbc:model-Epileptor skos:narrowMatch <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor> , <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor2D> , <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Epileptor5D> .
tvbc:model-StefanescuJirsa3D skos:exactMatch <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/StefanescuJirsa3D> .
tvbc:model-DodyNextGen skos:closeMatch <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/MontbrioPazoRoxin> .
tvbc:model-Hopf skos:closeMatch <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/SupHopf> .
tvbc:model-Wendling skos:exactMatch <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/Wendling> .
tvbc:model-DynamicCausalModel skos:exactMatch <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/CanonicalMicrocircuit> .
tvbc:model-SpikingEI skos:relatedMatch <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/CavallariConductanceLIF> .
tvbc:model-BasalGanglia skos:relatedMatch <https://w3id.org/tvbo/models/MaithBasalGangliaNeuron> .
